PLACEHOLDER: this is not a key yet.

The owner replaces this file with the public half of the CI signing key:

    cosign generate-key-pair

then stores cosign.key and its password as the COSIGN_PRIVATE_KEY and COSIGN_PASSWORD
repository secrets, and commits only this cosign.pub (cosign.key is git-ignored).

The image installs this file as /etc/pki/containers/zeroos-cosign.pub. While it is a
placeholder, the image's signature policy refuses every ghcr.io/nyharena25/zeroos image,
and CI refuses to publish.
